{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_07_beg","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_07","title":"梦的余韵","storyCode":"NL-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"38a38dfe85e15a7e15acf5b90bab711ea552cbbd5c0ec9564709f96584559945","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 7-1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样了，征战骑士的目的地是哪里？监正院吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们去了，冠军墙展厅，历代冠军挂像与颁奖之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么？他们不应该立刻去政府那边吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"董事会正在讨论此事。在我看来，这是监正会试图挽回颜面的一步棋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许下一步......也许下一步，他们会尝试让驻军成为常态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在的卡西米尔，可不是他们把刀架在别人脖子上就说了算的......愚昧的骑士还没能意识到这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴力的时代早就过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你另外走一趟零号地块了，断电对感染者收容治疗中心的影响很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看一看那里有没有出什么岔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，发言人阁下，电力系统......基本恢复了！正在准备重启！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗中的银光一路行过。\n嘈杂的观众围绕着这一场奢华的登场。\n路灯扑闪，随即，霓虹色彩回到了这座小睡片刻的城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"narration","text":"银枪的天马在广告灯光的簇拥下显得格格不入。\n但是，在场的每一个人，凑热闹的路人、慌张的骑士、兴奋的游客......\n他们都产生了错觉，他们都认为，是天马带来了光。\n是城市在他们的身后，逐步恢复活力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"......见过伊奥莱塔宗师。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许久不见，莱姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长途跋涉辛苦了，但可惜，我们似乎没有什么时间休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不需要休息，为卡西米尔扫清污秽才是当务之急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......你还是老样子，这么性急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想去见一见这场宴会的主角吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛嘉烈·临光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"当年她就不应该拒绝宗师的邀请，她本会是我们中最优秀的一批，而不用沦落至此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，她再次回到卡西米尔，却重新站上了那种虚伪的擂台......莫非流放让玛嘉烈改变了想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是和玛嘉烈决斗过的，你觉得她是那样的孩子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......但时间能改变一切，玛嘉烈如今......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这面墙，莱姆，特锦赛的历代冠军们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么从这个逐渐崩溃的时代中脱颖而出的骑士，他们依旧能蕴含光芒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"......只出现一两位优秀的骑士，并不能说明什么，宗师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士竞技依旧只是纯粹的亵渎，是卡西米尔的祸根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"每一次回到大骑士领，我都更加悲哀愤懑，我们的人民正在丧失敬畏，高尚的品德反倒成了迂腐的笑话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许吧，自从征战骑士离开大骑士领后，就一直如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊奥莱塔·罗素","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜时代在年轻人手上，我们得出的答案，已经无关紧要了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来博士你已经察觉到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们不能在卡西米尔的中心做得太过火。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米娅和各位干员的安全才是第一考量。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我想各位都不会同意我们轻举妄动。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白，本来，临光也不希望我们在特锦赛期间还回到你的身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"但我从当地感染者口中得到的消息越来越不可忽视......我认为，阿米娅和博士应该知道这件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，闪灵小姐的判断是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果感染者真的在零号地块遭到了......某种不人道的待遇，那我们就不该以“安危”为借口袖手旁观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......博士的顾虑也有道理......卡西米尔和乌萨斯、龙门都不同......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"想象一下。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们现在炸毁设施，救出所有感染者，逃离卡西米尔。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......暴力是不可行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦真的越过了那条线，罗德岛顷刻间就会淹没在卡西米尔的力量之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们身处卡西米尔的中央。也许这个国度与乌萨斯有本质上的不同，但......这里还是骑士之国。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"无论它的内部矛盾激化到了什么地步，它仍旧是卡西米尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛绝不能与它为敌。"}]},{"label":"我们立刻去和联合会洽谈，花钱买下所有的感染者。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......罗、罗德岛应该做不到吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就算真的用钱买下了所有的感染者......在这之后呢？难道大骑士领就不会出现新的感染者了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，这只会单纯地让感染者变成......可交易的商品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这解决不了什么问题。"}]},{"label":"我们马上向国民院检举揭发此事，寄希望于监正会。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会......我们还不知道零号地块的全貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会和商业联合会的博弈从未停止过，监正会对于感染者的态度也是模棱两可......也许监正会从一开始就默许了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......真的还能做到些什么吗？"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"char_147_shining","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎么办？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"用他们的办法，解决他们的问题。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"在那边！追！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（电力已经恢复了......索娜应该会想办法回去集合才对。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻通知增援——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里转个弯——唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"本来在零号地块待得好好的......突然一下灯就黑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为无胄盟终于不愿意给哨卡的房子付电费了，结果就收到了支援请求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......白金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......又是你吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"真希望上一次你和焰尾骑士已经吃够苦头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾......我是越挨打，越反抗的类型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"让开——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"不长记性......那只好给你点颜色看看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（被拉开了距离——只要挡住这一箭就能找到反击的机会！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里！帮助白金大位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟——背后——！？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！打碎了路灯吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......要是被玻璃划破脸可怎么办......真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"查丝汀娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫，快撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们会想办法拖住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......碍事，先找到掩体，确认方位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"制式轻弩的射击距离不会太远......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"不，而且有两个人吗——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远牙，她好像察觉到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......转移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要在狙击领域挑战无胄盟，但是......现在是二对一。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（停火了......转移了吗？敏锐的家伙。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（早知道这么麻烦我就当没听见求援了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"（但是......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"闭上眼。\n白金突然回想起了很久以前，父母对自己说过的话。\n他们说，她敏锐的视力一定会为家族带来荣耀。\n现在，她荣耀吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住你了，瑟奇亚克。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"风暴般掠过的箭矢划过瑟奇亚克的脸庞。\n只差一点，他的脑袋就很难保持完整了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——她反击了？这么远的距离！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？瑟奇亚克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！别停下，继续移动！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"吁——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......下一箭，送给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......特制的箭头......可怕的威力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么复杂的城市地形，她还能准确捕捉到我们的动向吗......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"是逃走了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没打算......就这么逃走，白金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......把我的家人怎么了！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他们怎么了！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......远距离行不通，就改近身搏杀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"想得真好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"多狼狈啊......一位父亲，因为反抗无胄盟落到如此下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你这——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有杀你的妻子和孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你把他们藏哪儿了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你愿意听从无胄盟的安排，甚至可以先和他们通个电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你是要我出卖红松骑士团？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一位父亲......还是一位骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"有必要为感染者做到这一步吗？瑟奇亚克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白金大位......到此为止了。这个距离，你的动作再快也快不过箭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......选择吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个个的......都不把骑士放在眼里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"任何人参加骑士竞技都能成为骑士，只不过老牌骑士家族更容易一些罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"所谓的骑士......只是......让人失望的一场梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"——你的自尊心比你的家人还重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我根本不打算相信你，下作的杀手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动手！远牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"路上已经恢复秩序了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"真是一场大动乱啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......会是索娜她们做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许，有其他人推波助澜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们内心充满愤怒与不公，她们想要反抗，感染者的反抗......最后却遭人利用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的惨剧......我经历过许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛嘉烈，你想要帮助她们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为感染者而战，和以骑士身份而战，在如今的卡西米尔，这是两个互相矛盾的选择——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——感染者所遭遇的不公，只是无数苦难在我们眼前的缩影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信有人会去为感染者伸张正义，而且，我也相信他们一定能够做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但只靠我们去拯救是不行的。只靠那些已经觉醒了坚定意志的人去拯救，是不够的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......稀客。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"阁下，久疏问候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......别对我行礼，我甚至连骑士都不是，别忘了你的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是来找玛嘉烈的，那可能要让你失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"......很多年没有回过大骑士领，英雄的家，已经变成这副模样了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"那对姐妹已经不住在这里了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，失礼......这是您的家庭问题，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有别的事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳阁下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"别那么叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人可以贬低您，我们不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"即使玛嘉烈误入歧途，她的妹妹还尚且年幼，但临光家族可不是靠着历史和名声来博得尊敬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"那些自诩精英的商人们就是洞察不到这一本质，才会对骑士们的种种行为感到不解，呸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是看到您身体安康，也令人安心几分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在这副模样？少说客套话吧，骑士阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您真为我着想，就请回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“银枪的天马”","speakerId":"avg_npc_224","isRemote":false,"text":"请允许我们，向您......不，向临光家族致以最崇高的敬意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......英雄已经落幕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"一个普通的卡西米尔人，当得起银枪皮加索斯的郑重行礼吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是个奇妙的夜晚。博士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经快日出了，很抱歉我没能第一时间赶来，联合会总是有很多事情需要处理......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"您是怎么看待零号地块的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以当作您这番话......没有弦外之音吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是个聪明人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很遗憾。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您觉得......大骑士领如此对待感染者，是一件合理的举措吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您无需回答，你我都知道答案——折中的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们做不出最完美最富有人性的选择，又不愿选择最血腥最原始的答案时，这就是结果。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这并不合理，马克维茨先生。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道吗......其实如果您读过一些卡西米尔的史书，您就会意识到，我们如今的社会建立在怎样的“不合理”上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您也许不了解......在天马的国度因梦魇带来的动荡被推翻，骑士团立国之后，是扈从们最先真正团结了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扈从们为骑士运作财产，为骑士打理土地，之后，扈从们又联起手来，将那些暴虐无道的大骑士们赶下了台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在呢？商业联合会豢养着杀手组织与竞技骑士，而被豢养的一方则永远会奋起反抗，试图摆脱权力的桎梏——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......历史就是一个循环，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前的发言人做了一些龌龊的勾当，也因此付出了代价，现在，轮到我处于这个位置，艰苦前行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些东西，符合您的道德观念吗？它，“合理”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道您是怎么知道的......但您应该已经察觉到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对那些在赛场上重度伤残的、矿石病加剧到无法遏制的，联合会选择了......人道处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不合理？当然，我也想说“不行”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但难道要我们永远养着那些感染者病人吗？这种无法解决的疾病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病一天不能被“治愈”，那我们就一天做不到和平共处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“处理”那些仍然挣扎求生的人，这叫谋杀。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凡是觉得不合理的人都被排除了，这才造就了每一段合理的历史，所幸我已经接受了这个道理，您难道不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这是在试图挑战卡西米尔......我不建议您这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也许确实有别的办法。如果您能想到什么，我愿意帮助您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜大断电的首要嫌疑人，就是感染者骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如，只是假如，假如断电引发了一场车祸，或是让一位依赖家庭呼吸机的老人停止了呼吸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道出于帮助感染者的立场，我们就要对这些悲剧，也视而不见吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"允许感染者大批出现在赛场上，所有人都为此承担了许多压力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这股压力正来自于社会本身，而不是某个人、某个团体，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但现在，感染者在死去，我们在袖手旁观。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻，有很多人在非正常地死亡，疾病，天灾，我们帮不了所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉。"}]},{"label":"您说得对，“我们也许确实有别的办法”。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您有什么想法......我相信，您可以做到一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但请记住我说的话，不要把这件事当做一件好似扶老人过马路一般的事情去对待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"零号地块的矛盾是十分复杂的。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，也许是我话说得太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能冷静下来思考一下，对我们都有好处。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人想要见您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我就不打扰您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会......如果可能，我还是希望站在您这边的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，要从无数的“不合理”和“无能为力”之中，把最可能的答案选出来，是一件很困难的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得对......大断电，耀骑士，血骑士，这也许反而给了那些感染者骑士抗争的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在事情一发不可收拾之前，希望你我能避免太多的......伤亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“好人能有一个好下场”，在如今，已经是一件需要去争取才能实现的事情了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_147_shining","aliases":["闪灵"]},{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
